  "body": "Let's try using this branch as a shared place to push changes that remove as many of the current XXX comments in the spec as we can easily resolve without a huge amount effort. Then afterwards, if we have any remaining ones, let’s change them to TODO comments instead.\n\nOtherwise the build just spits out that same list of XXX stuff at the end every single time and that’s not useful in practice because we just end up ignoring it.\n\nXXX is (I think) supposed to used just as a personal reminder about something that you want t to fix/finish before you finish work on the change and merge it. I think it’s intended that nothing should ever end up getting merged if it has added a XXX flag.\n",
